ed}\n&\\int \\bigl(3\\cos x-2\\sin x\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\n&=3\\int \\cos x\\,\\mathrm{d}x-2\\int \\sin x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\n&=3\\bigl(\\sin x\\bigr)-2\\bigl(-\\cos x\\bigr)+C\\\\\n&=2\\cos x+3\\sin x+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary constant. Differentiating the result gives $3\\cos x-2\\sin x$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186720901 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "65c545f9-5696-572d-bb4c-de9bfeb9b4db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\cos x-6\\sin x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720886} {:answer/id #uuid "7c09b9a9-7ae2-59e7-b6a9-77d12918aa06" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6\\cos x+4\\sin x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720889} {:answer/id #uuid "a31f6f0f-ca00-5cd4-9d68-6f2a2f3a22f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\cos x-6\\sin x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720896} {:answer/id #uuid "f67a9066-f4db-5f1c-b265-61d15235f614" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\cos x+6\\sin x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720905} {:answer/id #uuid "f91b7568-3127-5585-ab7b-f45f15857614" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\cos x+6\\sin x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720907}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a31f6f0f-ca00-5cd4-9d68-6f2a2f3a22f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\cos x-6\\sin x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720896} :answer-field/id #uuid "798e2096-7294-5f98-a312-ddc9650f7e15" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720888}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "d6a32b57-cddb-5fa8-8f79-069553dc1d03" :question/problem "Calculate\n\n$$\n\\int \\bigl[-6\\cos x-4\\sin x\\bigr]\\,\\mathrm{d}x.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int \\sin x\\,\\mathrm{d}x&=-\\cos x+C.\\\\\n\\int \\cos x\\,\\mathrm{d}x&=\\sin x+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the constant multiple and sum rules:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\int \\bigl(-6\\cos x-4\\sin x\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\n&=-6\\int \\cos x\\,\\mathrm{d}x-4\\int \\sin x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\n&=-6\\bigl(\\sin x\\bigr)-4\\bigl(-\\cos x\\bigr)+C\\\\\n&=4\\cos x-6\\sin x+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary constant. Differentiating the result gives $-6\\cos x-4\\sin x$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186720916 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "435a1ced-2d3c-53b3-81c7-7bc78d7508f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6\\csc y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720915} {:answer/id #uuid "84bfa66d-484f-5d91-97c9-8818c71b1fe2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\csc y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720919} {:answer/id #uuid "8e35949b-01e5-5665-af0f-acb48d64413f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\csc^{2} y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720920} {:answer/id #uuid "c02f2d37-a22d-57c4-8402-b95f59bd1f55" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\cot y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720925} {:answer/id #uuid "d2a2efd6-b4df-5472-923f-c748a0137e44" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\sec y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720928}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "84bfa66d-484f-5d91-97c9-8818c71b1fe2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\csc y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720919} :answer-field/id #uuid "b7a5cf53-3a55-50bb-a617-7375fc574d33" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720924}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "64d32a92-93fd-549a-9677-fcc2bdd3c5c0" :question/problem "Calculate\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\int (-6\\csc y\\cot y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int \\csc y\\cot y\\,\\mathrm{d}y=-\\csc y+C.\n$$\n\nTaking the constant outside the integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int (-6\\csc y\\cot y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y\n&=-6\\int \\csc y\\cot y\\,\\mathrm{d}y \\\\\n&=-6(-\\csc y)+C \\\\\n&=6\\csc y+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe two negative signs cancel. Differentiating $6\\csc y$ gives $-6\\csc y\\cot y$, as required."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186720926 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2f0f486e-2581-5967-9cc8-90e64abc2bf8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sec x+\\csc x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720913} {:answer/id #uuid "341ceb83-1e66-5dde-a671-eb813d60ecac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\sec x+\\csc x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720914} {:answer/id #uuid "a6ca2993-c87a-5863-8bf2-d52bb88fd18b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\tan x-\\cot x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720921} {:answer/id #uuid "ad263b27-9a6d-5b22-837d-b6dcab71ce4b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sec x-\\csc x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720923} {:answer/id #uuid "d1f76b86-5955-52e8-8994-ee306d2aca52" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\sec x-\\csc x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720927}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2f0f486e-2581-5967-9cc8-90e64abc2bf8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sec x+\\csc x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720913} :answer-field/id #uuid "7b57c50f-8714-5c86-84a3-2bd961a86719" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720917}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "cb6b9844-8f2c-54fb-8213-710ba8f1ce5f" :question/problem "Calculate\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\int \\frac{\\sin^{3}x-\\cos^{3}x}{\\sin^{2}x\\cos^{2}x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x.\n$$\n\nWork on an interval where $\\sin x\\cos x\\ne 0$." :question/worked-solution "Split the fraction and cancel common factors in each term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{\\sin^{3}x-\\cos^{3}x}{\\sin^{2}x\\cos^{2}x}\n&=\\frac{\\sin^{3}x}{\\sin^{2}x\\cos^{2}x}-\\frac{\\cos^{3}x}{\\sin^{2}x\\cos^{2}x} \\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos^{2}x}-\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin^{2}x}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the reciprocal and quotient definitions to recognize the derivative pairs:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos^{2}x}&=\\frac{1}{\\cos x}\\cdot\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos x}=\\sec x\\tan x, \\\\\n\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin^{2}x}&=\\frac{1}{\\sin x}\\cdot\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}=\\csc x\\cot x.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int \\frac{\\sin^{3}x-\\cos^{3}x}{\\sin^{2}x\\cos^{2}x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n&=\\int (\\sec x\\tan x-\\csc x\\cot x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\n&=\\sec x-(-\\csc x)+C \\\\\n&=\\sec x+\\csc x+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAll cancellations hold on the stated interval. Differentiating $\\sec x+\\csc x$ recovers $\\sec x\\tan x-\\csc x\\cot x$, which equals the original integrand there."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186720930 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "247a1bf3-5ea0-5abb-91be-1a152f57dead" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sec x\\tan x-3\\csc x\\cot x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720911} {:answer/id #uuid "29c2a195-cb97-5375-a112-73ef2aa764bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sec x-3\\csc x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720912} {:answer/id #uuid "80db4636-49ca-58de-9359-f2598a031d48" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\sec x+3\\csc x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720918} {:answer/id #uuid "d313ef63-333a-51a5-a84f-cac63ce64209" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sec x+3\\csc x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720929} {:answer/id #uuid "f39f527f-8671-5d4e-8c79-974cd91d78ae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\tan x+3\\cot x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720931}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d313ef63-333a-51a5-a84f-cac63ce64209" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sec x+3\\csc x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720929} :answer-field/id #uuid "a8dedd06-4902-5513-8cdc-01bb2e185f74" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720922}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "e1a35faf-4dec-54c7-aeea-7073d809746a" :question/problem "Calculate\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\int (2\\sec x\\tan x-3\\csc x\\cot x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall the two antiderivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int \\sec x\\tan x\\,\\mathrm{d}x&=\\sec x+C, \\\\\n\\int \\csc x\\cot x\\,\\mathrm{d}x&=-\\csc x+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate each term with its coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&2\\int \\sec x\\tan x\\,\\mathrm{d}x-3\\int \\csc x\\cot x\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\n&\\quad=2\\sec x-3(-\\csc x)+C \\\\\n&\\quad=2\\sec x+3\\csc x+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse one arbitrary constant for the sum. Differentiating the result gives $2\\sec x\\tan x-3\\csc x\\cot x$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186720938 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "321e465f-ecd2-503d-98bf-91f3016528e8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\sin y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720939} {:answer/id #uuid "927a7897-20dd-583b-9980-cc682a7d4490" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\cos y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720950} {:answer/id #uuid "ac1a8bab-5299-5334-a40d-c02a942695f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\sin y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720955} {:answer/id #uuid "bc2fc992-d691-50a9-b667-be49187ae593" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\cos y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720956} {:answer/id #uuid "e73ca32d-a227-52cc-8c10-a40cee2ea95d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\sin y-4\\cos y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720959}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ac1a8bab-5299-5334-a40d-c02a942695f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\sin y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720955} :answer-field/id #uuid "8ff43f37-6d1e-5889-bc00-2c0d43fa6f1f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720949}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "2add9f67-ebd0-5278-bc8b-9dd2f7310388" :question/problem "Calculate\n\n$$\n\\int \\bigl[2\\bigl(\\sin y-\\cos y\\bigr)-2\\bigl(\\sin y+\\cos y\\bigr)\\bigr]\\,\\mathrm{d}y.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Distribute the constant factors and collect like terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&2\\bigl(\\sin y-\\cos y\\bigr)-2\\bigl(\\sin y+\\cos y\\bigr)\\\\\n&=2\\sin y-2\\cos y-2\\sin y-2\\cos y\\\\\n&=-4\\cos y.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRecall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int \\cos y\\,\\mathrm{d}y&=\\sin y+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the constant multiple rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\int \\bigl(-4\\cos y\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\\\\n&=-4\\int \\cos y\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\\\\n&=-4\\bigl(\\sin y\\bigr)+C\\\\\n&=-4\\sin y+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary constant. Differentiating the result gives $-4\\cos y$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186720941 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04a5fef4-9444-5a7e-846c-fefe96edae4e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3\\sin y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720933} {:answer/id #uuid "1763f2a2-d8ed-5b2d-83ac-fe5067e86a72" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\cos y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720935} {:answer/id #uuid "cc8bda05-e820-529f-9031-368121534cd7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3\\cos y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720957} {:answer/id #uuid "d929acf6-fa7a-5871-adf9-77df24671719" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\sin y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720958} {:answer/id #uuid "eee0eab6-b662-5ff4-a21b-fd4d2a325e62" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\sin y+\\cos y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720960}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cc8bda05-e820-529f-9031-368121534cd7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3\\cos y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720957} :answer-field/id #uuid "6d38c2cc-2247-5cba-81d6-5e310b20df30" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720947}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "498cf586-f161-5fc9-b548-6b49c6a84da3" :question/problem "Calculate\n\n$$\n\\int \\bigl[1\\bigl(\\sin y-2\\cos y\\bigr)+2\\bigl(\\sin y+\\cos y\\bigr)\\bigr]\\,\\mathrm{d}y.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Distribute the constant factors and collect like terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&1\\bigl(\\sin y-2\\cos y\\bigr)+2\\bigl(\\sin y+\\cos y\\bigr)\\\\\n&=\\sin y-2\\cos y+2\\sin y+2\\cos y\\\\\n&=3\\sin y.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRecall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int \\sin y\\,\\mathrm{d}y&=-\\cos y+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the constant multiple rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\int \\bigl(3\\sin y\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\\\\n&=3\\int \\sin y\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\\\\n&=3\\bigl(-\\cos y\\bigr)+C\\\\\n&=-3\\cos y+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary constant. Differentiating the result gives $3\\sin y$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186720942 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4353ca63-0a3e-5594-a5a2-e12d648caa6a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\cos \\theta+5\\sin \\theta+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720940} {:answer/id #uuid "63a191ae-4d7e-5e0a-afae-40ad2485625a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\cos \\theta-5\\sin \\theta+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720944} {:answer/id #uuid "a7c21eaa-7137-57e9-baf4-4153bf139e5e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos \\theta-5\\sin \\theta+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720952} {:answer/id #uuid "ab79addb-9635-58be-8756-fafa84d20564" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos \\theta+5\\sin \\theta+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720953} {:answer/id #uuid "abd52dcd-7280-55d2-9942-bf1323b08a63" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\cos \\theta-3\\sin \\theta+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720954}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "63a191ae-4d7e-5e0a-afae-40ad2485625a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\cos \\theta-5\\sin \\theta+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720944} :answer-field/id #uuid "985b9310-23c0-54d2-8cfc-6ec8900d5892" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720951}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "50fafaf6-d67b-5ea3-af9c-f736b40b38ce" :question/problem "Calculate\n\n$$\n\\int \\bigl[2\\bigl(-2\\cos \\theta+\\sin \\theta\\bigr)-1\\bigl(\\cos \\theta+\\sin \\theta\\bigr)\\bigr]\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Distribute the constant factors and collect like terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&2\\bigl(-2\\cos \\theta+\\sin \\theta\\bigr)-1\\bigl(\\cos \\theta+\\sin \\theta\\bigr)\\\\\n&=-4\\cos \\theta+2\\sin \\theta-\\cos \\theta-\\sin \\theta\\\\\n&=-5\\cos \\theta+\\sin \\theta.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRecall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int \\sin \\theta\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta&=-\\cos \\theta+C.\\\\\n\\int \\cos \\theta\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta&=\\sin \\theta+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the constant multiple and sum rules:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\int \\bigl(-5\\cos \\theta+\\sin \\theta\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta\\\\\n&=-5\\int \\cos \\theta\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta+1\\int \\sin \\theta\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta\\\\\n&=-5\\bigl(\\sin \\theta\\bigr)+1\\bigl(-\\cos \\theta\\bigr)+C\\\\\n&=-\\cos \\theta-5\\sin \\theta+C.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary constant. Differentiating the result gives $-5\\cos \\theta+\\sin \\theta$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186720945 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f45926a-7a14-5d9e-89d7-702b04abe9b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sin \\theta+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720934} {:answer/id #uuid "29979ce8-8a2e-5d7a-be01-6104c2ee1461" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\sin \\theta+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186720937} {:answer/id #uuid "5c2e4295-3a6a-50aa-91fe-97dcbcda03b3" 